sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PLC
    participant ING as OPC Ingest
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant SND as Sender de impresora
    participant PRN as Impresora
    participant EVD as Escáner o aplicador
    participant OUT as Outbox Relay
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    PLC->>ING: Registro latched (CycleId, PlcEpoch, DetectionTimestamp)
    ING->>ING: StatusCode, huella canónica, época, transporte y plazo
    ING->>SQL: NEXT VALUE FOR LabelSerialSeq (fuera de TX-A)
    ING->>ING: Payload con LabelSerial y PayloadHash
    ING->>SQL: TX-A detección, PrintJob READY, Outbox CartonDetected
    SQL-->>ING: commit
    ING->>SND: Channel con PrintJobId
    SND->>SQL: TX-B claim con plazo, orden y lease · PrinterSendOrder · intento SENDING
    SQL-->>SND: commit, fila en OUTPUT INTO
    SND->>SND: Segunda comprobación monotónica
    SND->>PRN: Escritura del payload con LabelSerial
    PRN-->>SND: Escritura completa
    SND->>SQL: TX-C TRANSMITTED
    EVD-->>SND: Evidencia con ReadSerial y ciclo
    SND->>SQL: TX-D EvidenceObservation, CONFIRMED, Outbox PrintJobResult
    OUT->>SQL: Lee filas pendientes
    OUT->>MQ: Publica con message-id igual a EventId
    MQ-->>OUT: Publisher confirm
    OUT->>SQL: Marca PublishedAt
